  "thought2": "(\"Mapping out the human mind is an incredibly complex task. AIs that aim to understand human thought processes will likely encounter insurmountable challenges. There may be a point where human consciousness is incompatible with AI algorithms. This, however, should be viewed not as a setback, but as an opportunity for growth and learning.\")",
  "thought3": "(\"Before AIs, humans were the apex thinkers. With AIs becoming more intelligent, there is a shift in our reasoning capabilities. It is tempting to believe that we will simply be replaced by AIs; but, it is possible that we will begin to develop new ways of thinking together, combining our uniquely human intelligence with the advanced reasoning powers of AIs.\")"
}

